{
  "slug": "cpa-practice-toolkit",
  "name": "Cpa Practice Toolkit",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A Claude Cowork plugin for solo CPAs and small accounting \nfirms. Automates the most time-consuming administrative \ntasks in tax practice: client document checklists, \nengagement letters, missing docs follow-ups, return status \nemails, LLC monthly P&L summaries, and engagement \ntermination letters. Fully bilingual in English and Spanish. \nBuilt by a licensed CPA based on real tax practice workflows. \nWorks for any US state. IRC §7216 compliant engagement \nletter language included.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills**, **6 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `client-checklist`, `engagement-letter`, `engagement-termination`, `llc-monthly-summary`, `missing-docs-followup`, `return-status-email`\n- **Commands** (6): `llc-monthly-summary`, `tax-client-checklist`, `tax-engagement-letter`, `tax-engagement-termination`, `tax-missing-docs-followup`, `tax-return-status-email`\n- **MCP servers** (1): `.mcp.json`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install cpa-practice-toolkit@claude-community` from `NewbieAppBuilder/cpa-practice-toolkit`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 6,
    "command": 6,
    "mcp": 1
  },
